 "headline": "“And that’s what we like to call a labor of love.” - EventMarketer",
 "intro": "WE UNLEASHED A PREGNANT TROUPE ON THE STREETS OF LA TO PROMOTE THE THEATRICAL RELEASE OF BABES.",
